---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['charles-county'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Charles County | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Charles County, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Experienced Legal Representation in Charles County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Charles County in Southern Maryland has experienced tremendous growth over the past two decades, 
    with Waldorf becoming one of the state's largest communities. This rapid development brings 
    increased traffic, construction activity, and unfortunately, more accidents and injuries. 
    Attorney Alex Poberesky provides dedicated legal representation to Charles County residents 
    facing personal injury claims and criminal charges.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Charles County</h3>
  
  <p>
    The busy corridors of Route 301, Route 228, and Route 210 see heavy traffic volumes daily, 
    leading to frequent accidents. Whether you've been injured in a collision in Waldorf, hurt 
    in a construction accident in one of the county's many new developments, or suffered injuries 
    at a local business, we can help you seek the compensation you deserve.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle personal injury cases throughout Charles County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car and truck accidents on Routes 301, 228, and 210</li>
    <li>Construction site injuries</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at shopping centers and businesses</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at local hospitals and clinics</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries</li>
    <li>Motorcycle and bicycle accidents</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Charles County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Facing criminal charges in Charles County can be overwhelming. Whether you've been charged 
    with DUI, drug possession, assault, theft, or any other criminal offense, you need an 
    experienced defense attorney who will protect your rights and fight for the best possible 
    outcome.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Local Knowledge, Statewide Experience</h3>
  
  <p>
    Our firm brings over 26 years of experience practicing law throughout Maryland. We understand 
    the unique challenges facing Charles County residents and are familiar with the local court 
    system. We travel to Charles County to meet with clients and appear in court, providing the 
    same level of personalized service we offer to all our clients.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Charles County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Charles County, including Waldorf, La Plata, Indian Head, 
    Bryans Road, White Plains, Potomac Heights, and St. Charles. Our commitment to fighting 
    for your rights extends to every corner of the county.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
